         <div type="bio">
            <p>Celebrated French painter, printmaker and designer. Matisse was commissioned to design illustrations for the edition of <name type="work" key="ID_MISSING">Ulysses</name> published by the Limited Editions Club in 1935. Matisse paid scant attention to Joyce’s books, but instead designed figures from Homer’s <name type="work" key="ID_MISSING">Odyssey</name>. <hi rend="bold">William Brockman</hi>
                </p>
